## Xcode / iOS
# CocoaPods' installed output -- 96MB here, ~94MB of it WebRTC-lib's
# prebuilt xcframework binaries. Reproducible from Podfile.lock (which IS
# committed) via `pod install`, and committing it would permanently add
# ~96MB to every clone of this repo -- removable afterwards only by
# rewriting history. Standard CocoaPods guidance for a project that
# commits its lockfile.
iosApp/Pods/
iosApp/**/xcuserdata/
iosApp/**/*.xcworkspace/xcuserdata/
iosApp/**/DerivedData/
iosApp/**/*.xcodeproj/project.xcworkspace/xcuserdata/
iosApp/**/*.xcodeproj/xcuserdata/
*.ipa
*.dSYM.zip
*.dSYM

